<title>USA: Dentsply buys French firm for $4 mln.</title>
<headline>Dentsply buys French firm for $4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa.</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dentsply International Inc said Tuesday it closed a deal to buy SIMFRA S.A., a Paris-based dental products company, for $4 million in cash.</p>
<p>Dentsply, a maker and distributor of dental products, said the acquisition is expected to add about $2.0 million to its annual sales.</p>
</text>
